fixture hazard_loop_stick_held_floor_spikes
doc (movement review 4, M1) the same loop on level ground: walking right into a strip of floor spikes, holding right throughout. Safe ground needs no spikes within a tile of the hurtbox, so the respawn is at x 441 u, 39 u short of the strip at 480 u; the held stick walks Ash back onto it within the 20 f invulnerability, and the frame that ends Ash is sent back again: a loop every 20 frames (frames 22, 42, 62, ...) for as long as the stick is held.
room test/spikes
spawn 300 512
frames 200
input
  0..199 R
end
expect
  mark die1 0..199 event.hazard=1
  never die1+1..die1+60 event.hazard=1
end
